  "title": "The last letters",
  "goal": "Know every letter in the alphabet and read છાશ, ભાષા and ગાંઠિયા.",
  "tip": "Gujarati has three s-letters: સ is s, and શ and ષ are both said sh. છ is the breathy ch you'll meet in છે (is). ઋ and its sign ૃ say ru, mostly in words from Sanskrit.",
  "lessons": [
